<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>State Machine Integrati=
on</strong>: Using XState or a custom FSM to ensure <strong>valid state tra=
nsitions</strong> and prevent invalid user flows</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Granular Document State=
</strong>: Each document type maintains its own lifecycle and retry logic</=
li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Compliance Integration<=
/strong>: Real-time risk scoring and regulatory checks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Audit Trail</strong>: E=
very state change includes metadata for compliance reporting</li>
</ol>
